<title>HONG KONG: Chung Hwa seeks to resume trade Feb 19.</title>
<headline>Chung Hwa seeks to resume trade Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging products maker Chung Hwa Development Holdings Ltd said on Monday it will apply to the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong Ltd for its shares and warrants to resume trade with effect on Wednesday, February 19.</p>
<p>Trade in the firm's shares and warrants was suspended on January 17 at the request of Securities and Futures Commission, the local securities watchdog.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
